sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Req as Requirement
    participant Acc as Access pattern
    participant Con as Consistency need
    participant Sc as Scale and shape
    participant Ch as Choice
    Req->>Acc: what are the reads and writes, really?
    Acc-->>Req: point lookups, ranges, or full scans
    Req->>Con: what breaks if a read is stale?
    alt money or inventory
        Con-->>Ch: strong consistency, pay the latency
    else feed or metrics
        Con-->>Ch: eventual is fine, buy the availability
    end
    Req->>Sc: how big, how fast, how bursty?
    Sc-->>Ch: partitioning key and growth path
    Ch->>Ch: pick the boring option that satisfies all three
    Note over Ch: the interesting choice is the one you can operate at 3am
